    <string name="a11y_label">Utils</string>
    <string name="a11y_description">One switch for every Utils tool that needs it. Watch remote reads which app is on screen so it can close it, and locks the screen or opens apps only when your paired watch asks. Solve takes a screenshot of the screen when you start it and shows its result card above your app. Nothing else is read, stored or sent anywhere.</string>
